open-lmake ($VERSION_TAG-$DEBIAN_RELEASE) $OS_CODENAME; urgency=low

  * General robustness release after throrouh AI analysis

  * support slurm v26.05 and wckey option
  * support link_support=full_ext to include possibility of external symlinks to within repo
  * implement slower write based tracing in addition to faster mmap based tracing
  * improve dangling detection versus unlink/quarantine
  * fix ldebug reporting deps/targets in random order
  * forbid io_uring unless explicitly allowed
  * add Claude skill for improved experience with Claude
  * support gcc-16

 -- Cesar Douady <cesar.douady@doliam.fr>  $DATE
